These files contain adapted portions. Each keeps The Crossplane Authors'
copyright notice in its header, names the upstream file and states that it
was modified:

- cmd/provider/main.go: command-line flags, manager options and feature
  wiring, from cmd/provider/main.go of provider-template and provider-sql.
- internal/controller/config/config.go: the ProviderConfig and
  ClusterProviderConfig usage controllers, from
  pkg/controller/namespaced/mysql/config/config.go of provider-sql.
- apis/clickhouse.go and apis/v1alpha1/register.go: API scheme registration,
  from the corresponding files of provider-template and provider-sql.

The repository layout follows provider-template, and resolving a managed
resource's ProviderConfig or ClusterProviderConfig by the kind of its
reference follows provider-sql.
